{{!
    @template mod_edpreset/chooser_section_tag

    A recommended section, shown as a pseudo tag: on a preset card, on a section template card and in
    the filter bar. One partial for all three, because mod_edpreset/chooser keys a filter off
    data-tag and data-tagtype together and the three copies must never disagree on either.

    data-tagtype="section" is what keeps it a filter of its own, separate from an ordinary tag that
    happens to share its name.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name string - the section name, as the curator typed it

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Nau mai | Welcome"
    }
}}
<button type="button"
        class="edpreset-tag edpreset-tag-section"
        data-action="tag"
        data-tagtype="section"
        data-tag="{{name}}"
        aria-pressed="false"
        aria-label="{{#str}} chooser:filterbysection, mod_edpreset, {{name}} {{/str}}"
        title="{{#str}} chooser:recommendedsection, mod_edpreset {{/str}}"
><i class="fa fa-solid fa-bars-staggered" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{name}}</button>
